{"consistent_measurement_of_disease_severity_within_and_across_timepoints_and_clinical_trials": "Consistent measurement of disease severity within and across timepoints and clinical trials refers to the capability of maintaining uniformity and reliability in assessing the extent or progression of a disease at different points in time and across various clinical studies."},
