{"the_problems_inherent_to_mash_histologic_assessment_that_lead_to_the_failure_of_clinical_trials": "The problems inherent to MASH histologic assessment that lead to the failure of clinical trials refer to the challenges and limitations in accurately evaluating and diagnosing MASH, which have resulted in the inability of clinical trials to achieve successful outcomes."},
{"aim_mash__is_being_evaluated_by__both_the_fda_and_the_ema_for_qualification_as_a_drug_discovery_tool_for_use_in_clinical_trials": "The phrase \"is being evaluated by\" indicates that AIM-MASH is currently under assessment or review. This evaluation is crucial for determining its suitability and effectiveness as a tool in drug discovery and clinical trials, particularly for conditions like MASH."},
{"both_the_fda_and_the_ema_for_qualification_as_a_drug_discovery_tool_for_use_in_clinical_trials": "Both the FDA (Food and Drug Administration) and the EMA (European Medicines Agency) are regulatory bodies responsible for the approval and monitoring of medical products, including drugs and diagnostic tools. Their evaluation of AIM-MASH is essential for its qualification as a reliable drug discovery tool for use in clinical trials, ensuring it meets the necessary standards for safety, efficacy, and reliability."},
{"aim_mash__is_well_poised_to_improve__the_accuracy_and_reproducibility_of_pathologists_evaluation_of_liver_biopsies_within_scalable_workflows": "The phrase \"is well poised to improve\" indicates that AIM-MASH has the potential and readiness to enhance certain aspects of medical evaluation. In this context, it suggests that AIM-MASH is prepared to make significant advancements in the field."},
