{"harrison_s_a_et_al__studied__selonsertib_for_patients_with_bridging_fibrosis_or_compensated_cirrhosis_due_to_nash": "The predicate'studied' indicates that the subject, Harrison, S. A. et al., conducted research or clinical trials to evaluate the effectiveness and safety of a specific treatment for a medical condition."},
{"selonsertib_for_patients_with_bridging_fibrosis_or_compensated_cirrhosis_due_to_nash": "Selonsertib for patients with bridging fibrosis or compensated cirrhosis due to NASH is a pharmaceutical treatment that was investigated in clinical trials for its efficacy in treating patients with advanced stages of nonalcoholic steatohepatitis, specifically those with bridging fibrosis or compensated cirrhosis."},
{"sanyal_a_et_al": "Sanyal, A. et al. refers to a group of authors led by Arun J. Sanyal, who are recognized for their research contributions in the field of hepatology, particularly concerning nonalcoholic steatohepatitis (NASH) and liver fibrosis.|Here is another description: Sanyal, A. et al. refers to a group of researchers led by Arun Sanyal who conducted studies on liver diseases, particularly nonalcoholic steatohepatitis (NASH)."},
