{"efficacy_and_safety_of_simtuzumab_for_the_treatment_of_nonalcoholic_steatohepatitis_with_bridging_fibrosis_or_cirrhosis": "The object 'Efficacy and safety of simtuzumab for the treatment of nonalcoholic steatohepatitis with bridging fibrosis or cirrhosis' refers to the specific focus of the research, which was to determine how well simtuzumab works and how safe it is for treating NASH in patients with significant liver fibrosis or cirrhosis."},
