{"simtuzumab_is_ineffective_for_patients_with_bridging_fibrosis_or_compensated_cirrhosis_caused_by_nonalcoholic_steatohepatitis": "The object \"Simtuzumab is ineffective for patients with bridging fibrosis or compensated cirrhosis caused by nonalcoholic steatohepatitis\" is the conclusion drawn by the researchers, stating that the drug Simtuzumab did not show effectiveness in treating patients with specific stages of NASH-related liver conditions."},
