{"loomba_r_et_al__studied__the_ask1_inhibitor_selonsertib_in_patients_with_nonalcoholic_steatohepatitis": "The predicate'studied' indicates that the subject, Loomba, R. et al., conducted research or an investigation into a specific topic, in this case, the ASK1 inhibitor selonsertib in patients with nonalcoholic steatohepatitis."},
