{"kitrinos_k_m_et_al": "Kitrinos, K. M. et al. refers to a group of authors led by Kitrinos, K. M., who conducted a study on the long-term efficacy and resistance profile of tenofovir disoproxil fumarate in patients with chronic hepatitis B.|Here is another description: Kitrinos, K. M. et al. refers to a group of researchers led by Kitrinos, who conducted a study on the long-term effects of tenofovir disoproxil fumarate in patients with chronic hepatitis B."},
