{"seladelpar_efficacy_and_safety_at_3_months_in_patients_with_primary_biliary_cholangitis": "Seladelpar efficacy and safety at 3 months in patients with primary biliary cholangitis refers to the specific focus of the study conducted by Hirschfield, G. M. et al. This object describes the evaluation of the drug Seladelpar in terms of its effectiveness and safety profile over a three-month period in patients diagnosed with primary biliary cholangitis, a chronic liver disease."},
{"pedregosa_f_et_al": "Pedregosa, F. et al. refers to a group of authors led by Fabian Pedregosa, who have contributed to a publication in the field of machine learning research.|Here is another description: Pedregosa, F. et al. refers to a group of authors led by Fabian Pedregosa, who are recognized for their contributions to machine learning research, particularly in the development of scikit-learn, a popular machine learning library in Python."},
