{"key_genes_associated_with_fibrogenesis_in_patients_with_advanced_nash": "The key genes associated with fibrogenesis in patients with advanced NASH are specific genetic markers identified by the researchers that play a crucial role in the development of fibrosis in patients with advanced non-alcoholic steatohepatitis (NASH)."},
