{"academic_investigators_without_relevant_conflicts_of_interest_for_noncommercial_use": "Academic investigators without relevant conflicts of interest for noncommercial use are researchers affiliated with academic institutions who are permitted to access histopathology features for research purposes, provided they have no financial or other conflicts of interest that could bias their work and are not seeking commercial gain from the data."},
