{"academic_investigators__agree_to__not_distribute_the_data": "The phrase \"agree to\" signifies a condition or requirement that academic investigators must fulfill in order to gain access to the data. It implies a commitment or promise made by the investigators regarding the handling of the data."},
{"not_distribute_the_data": "\"Not distribute the data\" refers to the condition that academic investigators must promise to keep the data confidential and not share it with third parties. This is to maintain patient confidentiality and protect proprietary image analysis, as well as to ensure the data is used solely for the intended noncommercial research purposes."},
