{"access_requests__made_to__andrew_beck_andy_beck_pathai_com": "The predicate \"made to\" indicates the direction of the action, specifying that the access requests are directed towards a specific individual responsible for granting or denying these requests. This action is essential for maintaining the integrity and confidentiality of the data."},
{"andrew_beck_andy_beck_pathai_com": "Andrew Beck, with the email andy.beck@pathai.com, is the designated contact person at PathAI responsible for handling access requests. His role involves reviewing and responding to requests from academic investigators, ensuring that the data is accessed only by those who meet the study's criteria for noncommercial use and without conflicts of interest.|Here is another description: Andrew Beck, reachable at andy.beck@pathai.com, is the designated contact person at PathAI responsible for receiving and processing data requests. His role involves evaluating the requests to ensure they meet the criteria for access to sensitive histopathology data."},
