{"data_reported_in_this_paper_relating_directly_to_the_clinical_datasets": "Data reported in this paper relating directly to the clinical datasets refers to the specific sets of information collected during clinical trials that are pertinent to the study's conclusions. These datasets include STELLAR-3, STELLAR-4, GS-US-321-0105, GS-US321-0106, GS\u2010US\u2010384\u20101497, ENHANCE, HBV, PSC, EMMINENCE, and ATLAS, which contain detailed patient information and outcomes."},
