{"requests__considered_from__academic_investigators_without_relevant_conflicts_of_interest_for_noncommercial_use_who_agree_not_to_distribute_the_data": "The phrase \"considered from\" indicates the process by which requests are evaluated. It suggests that not all requests will be automatically granted; instead, they will be reviewed based on certain criteria, such as the absence of conflicts of interest and the intended use of the data."},
{"academic_investigators_without_relevant_conflicts_of_interest_for_noncommercial_use_who_agree_not_to_distribute_the_data": "Academic investigators without relevant conflicts of interest for noncommercial use who agree not to distribute the data are the specific group of individuals whose requests will be considered. This group is defined by their academic affiliation, the absence of conflicts that could bias their use of the data, their commitment to noncommercial use, and their agreement to keep the data confidential by not distributing it further."},
