{"more_granular_measurement_of_histological_changes": "A more granular measurement of histological changes refers to a detailed and precise assessment of alterations in tissue structure at a finer level than what traditional ordinal scoring systems can provide."},
{"histological_changes": "Histological changes refer to alterations in the microscopic structure of tissues, which can be observed and measured using various scoring systems."},
