{"a_greater_response_in_treated_patients_relative_to_placebo_for_all_three_endpoints": "A greater response in treated patients relative to placebo for all three endpoints refers to the observed outcomes where patients who received treatment showed more significant improvements across three different measures compared to those who received a placebo.|Here is another description: A greater response in treated patients relative to placebo for all three endpoints refers to the observed outcomes where patients who received treatment showed more significant improvements across three different measures compared to those who received a placebo."},
