{"younossi_z_m_et_al": "Younossi, Z. M. et al. refers to a group of researchers led by Zobair M. Younossi, who are recognized for their contributions to the study of liver diseases, particularly nonalcoholic steatohepatitis (NASH).|Here is another description: Younossi, Z. M. et al. refers to a group of researchers led by Zobair M. Younossi who conducted a study on the burden of illness and economic model for patients with nonalcoholic steatohepatitis in the United States.|Here is another description: Younossi, Z. M. et al. refers to a group of researchers led by Zobair M. Younossi who conducted a study on the burden of illness and economic model for patients with nonalcoholic steatohepatitis (NASH) in the United States."},
