{"kingwell_k": "Kingwell, K. is an author or reporter who has contributed to scientific literature, specifically in the field of drug discovery and liver diseases such as nonalcoholic steatohepatitis (NASH).|Here is another description: Kingwell, K. is an author who has contributed to the field of liver disease research, specifically focusing on nonalcoholic steatohepatitis (NASH). Their work is recognized in scientific literature for providing insights and updates on the progression and treatment of NASH.|Here is another description: Kingwell, K. is the author of an article published in _Nat. Rev. Drug Discov._ in 2024, focusing on the first FDA drug approval for the treatment of nonalcoholic steatohepatitis (NASH), a significant liver disease."},
