{"naoumov_n_v_et_al": "Naoumov, N. V. et al. refers to a group of researchers led by Dr. Naoumov, who are involved in the study of liver diseases, particularly nonalcoholic steatohepatitis (NASH).|Here is another description: Naoumov, N. V. et al. refers to a group of researchers led by Naoumov, N. V., who conducted a study on the application of digital pathology and artificial intelligence in analyzing treatment-induced fibrosis regression in nonalcoholic steatohepatitis (NASH).|Here is another description: Naoumov, N. V. et al. refers to a group of researchers led by Naoumov, N. V., who conducted a study on the use of digital pathology and artificial intelligence to analyze treatment-induced fibrosis regression in nonalcoholic steatohepatitis (NASH)."},
