{"loomba_r_et_al": "Loomba, R. et al. refers to a group of researchers led by Rohit Loomba, recognized for their contributions to hepatology, particularly in the study, treatment, and drug development for nonalcoholic steatohepatitis (NASH) and related liver diseases."},
