{"pai_r_k_et_al": "Pai, R. K. et al. refers to a group of authors led by R. K. Pai who have contributed to research in the field of nonalcoholic fatty liver disease (NAFLD), particularly focusing on the standardization of liver biopsy interpretation and the development of scoring systems for NAFLD.|Here is another description: Pai, R. K. et al. refers to a group of authors led by R. K. Pai, who have contributed to research in the field of hepatology, particularly focusing on the histological assessment and scoring systems for non-alcoholic fatty liver disease (NAFLD).|Here is another description: Pai, R. K. et al. refers to a group of researchers led by R. K. Pai who conducted a study on the reliability of histologic assessment for nonalcoholic fatty liver disease (NAFLD) and the development of an expanded NAFLD activity score.|Here is another description: Pai, R. K. et al. refers to a group of researchers led by R. K. Pai, who have contributed to the field of hepatology, particularly in the context of nonalcoholic fatty liver disease (NAFLD) and its assessment through liver biopsies."},
