{"reliability_of_histologic_assessment_for_nafld_and_development_of_an_expanded_nafld_activity_score": "The object 'Reliability of histologic assessment for NAFLD and development of an expanded NAFLD activity score' refers to the evaluation of the consistency and accuracy of liver biopsy interpretations in diagnosing and assessing the severity of nonalcoholic fatty liver disease, along with the creation of a more comprehensive scoring system to better quantify the disease's activity and progression."},
