{"controlled_process_and_testing_documentation": "Controlled process and testing documentation refer to the systematic and regulated procedures and records maintained during clinical trials and laboratory practices. This documentation ensures that all processes are conducted in a controlled and standardized manner, and that all testing procedures are meticulously recorded, reviewed, and verified to maintain the integrity and reliability of the trial data."},
