{"the_nature_portfolio_reporting_summary": "The Nature Portfolio Reporting Summary is a standardized document linked to a research article that provides a comprehensive overview of the research design, including experimental methods, data analysis, and other relevant details to ensure transparency and reproducibility."},
{"nature_portfolio_reporting_summary": "The Nature Portfolio Reporting Summary is a document that provides further information on the research design of a study. It is part of the Nature Portfolio's efforts to enhance transparency and reproducibility in scientific research."},
