{"pathai_s_intellectual_property": "PathAI\u2019s intellectual property refers to the proprietary knowledge, algorithms, and methodologies developed by PathAI, particularly in the field of medical diagnostics and analysis. This includes unique approaches to cell- and tissue-type model training, inference, and feature extractions."},
