{"javed_s_a_et_al": "Javed, S. A. et al. refers to a group of authors who have contributed to a research paper in the field of machine learning, specifically focusing on the evaluation of machine learning models in pathology.|Here is another description: Javed, S. A. et al. refers to a group of authors led by S. A. Javed who have contributed to research in the field of machine learning, particularly in its application to pathology."},
