{"manifold_mixup_better_representations_by_interpolating_hidden_states": "\"Manifold mixup: Better representations by interpolating hidden states\" is a research paper authored by Verma, V. et al. that introduces a novel technique called Manifold Mixup, which aims to enhance the representations learned by neural networks by interpolating hidden states during training.|Here is another description: Manifold mixup is a technique aimed at improving the representations learned by neural networks by interpolating hidden states. This method was proposed to enhance the generalization capabilities of models by creating better feature spaces."},
