{"niaaa": "NIAAA, the National Institute on Alcohol Abuse and Alcoholism, is one of the institutes under the NIH that provides funding for research related to alcohol use and its effects on health, and in this context, it is supporting R.L.'s research endeavors.|Here is another description: The National Institute on Alcohol Abuse and Alcoholism (NIAAA) is a U.S. government agency that supports and conducts research on the impact of alcohol use on health and well-being. It is part of the National Institutes of Health (NIH) and aims to disseminate research findings to improve the prevention and treatment of alcohol-related problems."},
