{"nature_medicine__thanks__faisal_mahmood": "The predicate \"thanks\" in this context signifies acknowledgment and appreciation by Nature Medicine towards individuals who have contributed their expertise and time to the peer review process of submitted works. This recognition is crucial for maintaining the integrity and quality of published research."},
