{"nature_medicine__thanks__the_other_anonymous_reviewer_s": "The predicate \"thanks\" in this context signifies acknowledgment and appreciation by Nature Medicine towards individuals who have contributed their time and expertise to evaluate and improve the quality of submitted work through the peer review process."},
{"the_other_anonymous_reviewer_s": "The other, anonymous, reviewer(s) refers to the unidentified individuals who, alongside Faisal Mahmood, provided valuable feedback and assessments during the peer review of a specific work submitted to Nature Medicine. Their identities are kept confidential to maintain the integrity and impartiality of the review process."},
