{"lorenzo_righetto_and_ming_yang__collaborate_with__the_nature_medicine_team": "The collaboration between Lorenzo Righetto, Ming Yang, and the Nature Medicine team signifies a joint effort in managing and facilitating the peer review process. This predicate highlights the cooperative nature of their work to maintain the standards of the journal."},
{"the_nature_medicine_team": "The Nature Medicine team is a group of professionals associated with the journal _Nature Medicine_. They are responsible for various editorial and review tasks to ensure the publication of high-quality scientific research."},
